WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 12=

01:52.600 --> 01:53.200
Good.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.040
This time, we must make sure

01:55.120 --> 01:56.560
Shen Zaiye and that concubine of his

01:57.640 --> 01:59.120
never return.

02:21.240 --> 02:22.000
Jiang Taohua,

02:22.960 --> 02:24.480
you're amazing! How did you pull it off?

02:24.560 --> 02:27.040
I can't believe my brother actually
brought me to the spring hunt!

02:27.120 --> 02:29.440
Who was it that said they'd be a dog
if they believed me again?

02:29.520 --> 02:32.000
That was a heat-of-the-moment thing.
Don't hold it against me.

02:38.600 --> 02:39.280
Mu Wuxia.

02:51.040 --> 02:54.360
Prince Wuxia seems to hold
some resentment toward you.

02:55.320 --> 02:56.040
He's just struggling

02:56.120 --> 02:57.760
to get over the hurdle in his heart.

02:59.200 --> 03:00.680
So it's true what people say

03:00.960 --> 03:03.840
that the Princess of Beiyuan
is deeply favored by Chancellor Shen.

03:05.160 --> 03:05.920
Prince Wuyin.

03:07.440 --> 03:09.120
Lady Jiang,
there's no need to be nervous.

03:09.600 --> 03:12.160
I simply felt
a certain connection with you

03:12.240 --> 03:13.600
and wished to express my greetings.

03:14.960 --> 03:15.560
Oh, right.

03:15.840 --> 03:18.320
Father is hosting
the Flowing Cups Banquet.

03:18.880 --> 03:20.080
If fate allows it,

03:20.320 --> 03:21.280
might we share a few drinks

03:21.360 --> 03:23.080
at the banquet, Lady Jiang?

03:24.600 --> 03:26.000
I'm honored, Prince Wuyin.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.400
Thank you for the invitation.

03:28.240 --> 03:30.520
But she hasn't yet bathed or changed.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.240
I'll take her back to our tent.

03:56.760 --> 03:57.480
Mu Wuxia.

03:57.760 --> 03:59.200
You're already at the hunting grounds.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.280
How are you still so dull?

04:00.360 --> 04:00.960
Come on!

04:01.400 --> 04:02.880
Compete with me in riding and archery!

04:09.920 --> 04:11.240
You don't want to leave the tent?

04:11.640 --> 04:12.920
Fine, we can just play pitch-pot.

04:31.600 --> 04:33.240
That's one! Your turn.

04:40.480 --> 04:41.840
All right, you win.

04:48.760 --> 04:50.160
You really are no fun.

04:50.720 --> 04:51.880
That was just the first throw.

04:53.440 --> 04:54.800
I don't need you to go easy on me.

04:58.400 --> 05:00.240
Why are you so determined
to compete with me?

05:00.840 --> 05:01.440
Can't you just

05:02.120 --> 05:03.240
let me read my books

05:03.320 --> 05:04.480
in peace?

05:04.720 --> 05:06.720
I haven't seen you turn a single page.

05:06.800 --> 05:09.560
You're reading the way I pretend to read
when dealing with my brother.

05:15.280 --> 05:16.120
True.

05:17.040 --> 05:18.480
But what good is reading, anyway?

05:19.360 --> 05:20.040
Books say

05:21.320 --> 05:22.520
only by acting justly

05:22.800 --> 05:24.280
can one serve both nation and people.

05:25.760 --> 05:27.560
Yet I trusted the wrong official

05:27.920 --> 05:29.000
and caused harm to Granny,

05:30.000 --> 05:31.200
with consequences like that.

05:33.200 --> 05:35.560
Clearly, everything I learned
was just theory on paper.

05:36.520 --> 05:38.600
When faced with reality,
it was completely useless.

05:40.880 --> 05:42.480
So if there were a next time,

05:42.680 --> 05:43.800
what would you do?

05:44.120 --> 05:45.640
Would you become like my brother?

05:48.720 --> 05:49.520
I'll admit

05:49.600 --> 05:51.600
Chancellor Shen has a sharp mind
and good foresight.

05:52.160 --> 05:54.800
But everything I was taught goes against

05:55.160 --> 05:56.760
his way of doing things.

05:57.640 --> 05:58.440
I can't be like him…

05:58.520 --> 05:59.120
Stop.

05:59.920 --> 06:01.240
Spare me the lecture.

06:01.880 --> 06:03.120
You're not entirely right.

06:03.280 --> 06:04.360
But neither is my brother.

06:04.880 --> 06:06.360
Getting hung up over that

06:11.040 --> 06:11.720
is a waste.

06:16.760 --> 06:18.680
Taking action is like firing an arrow.

06:18.760 --> 06:20.920
Once the bowstring is released,
there's no turning back.

06:21.000 --> 06:22.000
But the arrow missed.

06:22.400 --> 06:23.680
Then fire another.

06:24.360 --> 06:25.920
Pitch-pot is scored by total hits.

06:26.240 --> 06:27.760
Missing once doesn't matter.

06:28.160 --> 06:29.600
As long as my method is right,

06:30.000 --> 06:31.320
there'll always be another chance.

06:31.600 --> 06:32.640
How do you know

06:32.960 --> 06:34.200
your method is right?

06:34.760 --> 06:36.000
You throw from there.

06:36.160 --> 06:37.200
I throw from here.

06:37.880 --> 06:39.760
As long as my aim is the pot,

06:41.840 --> 06:42.920
I'll land a shot eventually.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.400
Two in a row!

06:49.040 --> 06:49.920
That's five!

06:55.120 --> 06:56.120
(Qingying is right.)

06:57.160 --> 06:58.800
(Instead of wallowing in guilt,)

06:59.760 --> 07:01.080
(it's better to set a clear goal.)

07:01.960 --> 07:03.200
(Maybe one day,)

07:03.960 --> 07:05.520
(I'll achieve
what I've set my heart on.)

07:12.680 --> 07:13.440
Leave us.

07:34.640 --> 07:35.880
What's your plan?

07:37.840 --> 07:39.040
I took a look on the way here.

07:39.200 --> 07:40.760
Everything seems flawless
on the surface.

07:40.960 --> 07:42.920
Prince Wugou has prepared thoroughly.

07:44.080 --> 07:45.200
This hunting ground is huge.

07:45.560 --> 07:47.680
Where are we even supposed to start
looking for clues?

07:48.920 --> 07:50.160
There wasn't enough time.

07:50.600 --> 07:52.320
They couldn't have made it perfect.

07:53.160 --> 07:54.120
If there's a flaw,

07:54.440 --> 07:55.720
we'll catch it.

07:56.160 --> 07:58.040
I've already sent Zhan Lu
to investigate in secret.

07:58.120 --> 08:00.520
Once the banquet starts,
we'll find an excuse to slip away.

08:01.200 --> 08:01.800
Chancellor,

08:01.880 --> 08:03.160
Prince Wuxia is here to see you.

08:03.760 --> 08:04.440
Go ahead.

08:08.360 --> 08:09.360
Your Highness,

08:09.880 --> 08:10.920
what brings you here today?

08:13.320 --> 08:14.600
What happened in Tianshui Village

08:15.400 --> 08:16.960
was due
to my ignorance and incompetence.

08:17.880 --> 08:21.400
I owe you
and all the villagers an apology.

08:24.600 --> 08:25.520
The matter is resolved.

08:26.520 --> 08:28.240
Your Highness,
you don't need to dwell on it.

08:29.080 --> 08:30.320
But after what happened,

08:30.760 --> 08:33.360
has anything changed in your heart?

08:34.120 --> 08:34.760
No.

08:35.480 --> 08:36.720
As soon as the spring hunt ends,

08:37.039 --> 08:39.360
I'll return to Yujing
as quickly as possible.

08:39.880 --> 08:40.919
I'll take all the evidence

08:41.000 --> 08:43.000
and report directly
to the governor of the capital.

08:43.559 --> 08:44.240
Since Qin,

08:44.360 --> 08:47.040
the governor of the capital has been
one of the three highest offices.

08:47.240 --> 08:48.840
It belongs to no noble faction

08:49.160 --> 08:50.560
and reports straight to the throne.

08:51.120 --> 08:51.840
At the same time,

08:52.280 --> 08:54.360
I'll assign people to protect
the villagers of Tianshui

08:54.840 --> 08:56.760
and the evidence, at any cost.

08:57.880 --> 08:58.960
Your Highness still intends

08:59.480 --> 09:00.600
to report it?

09:02.760 --> 09:03.360
Yes.

09:08.040 --> 09:08.800
Huaijin.

09:09.560 --> 09:10.960
What is the righteous path?

09:13.120 --> 09:16.120
It's the one that benefits the people
and ensures the nation's future.

09:16.480 --> 09:17.680
To walk that path,

09:17.760 --> 09:19.200
we first need to establish order.

09:19.720 --> 09:21.120
Only then can the path stay true.

09:21.640 --> 09:22.480
Xunzi said,

09:23.000 --> 09:24.840
"Orderliness is the mark of structure."

09:25.080 --> 09:26.000
That is the principle.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.240
I believe

09:29.960 --> 09:31.600
there's nothing wrong
with the law itself.

09:32.600 --> 09:34.680
Nor with reporting the matter.

09:35.520 --> 09:36.280
What's wrong

09:36.560 --> 09:38.960
are the corrupt officials
who twist the law for personal gain.

09:39.360 --> 09:40.360
The way to fix it

09:40.840 --> 09:42.680
isn't to lose faith in the law,

09:43.120 --> 09:44.560
but to create an environment

09:44.640 --> 09:45.960
where everyone follows it.

09:47.200 --> 09:48.160
The difficulty lies not

09:48.800 --> 09:49.880
in making laws,

09:50.320 --> 09:51.800
but in ensuring they are upheld.

09:52.760 --> 09:54.160
If even a prince like me can't follow

09:54.240 --> 09:55.600
and trust the law,

09:56.080 --> 09:57.600
who else would?

10:02.840 --> 10:03.640
Chancellor Shen,

10:04.800 --> 10:06.440
do you still think
I'm hopelessly stubborn?

10:10.720 --> 10:11.360
No.

10:13.040 --> 10:15.880
I only hope
you never lose your convictions.

10:25.360 --> 10:26.120
Your Highness.

10:26.840 --> 10:28.720
Did something happen to you?

10:29.360 --> 10:31.920
You seem much happier than before.

10:35.200 --> 10:36.600
A moment of clarity

10:37.040 --> 10:38.360
can bring great joy.

10:45.320 --> 10:46.400
The world is filled

10:47.080 --> 10:48.120
with all kinds of wonders.

10:49.080 --> 10:50.280
Each with its own truth.

10:51.400 --> 10:52.640
And if I can present the world

10:53.360 --> 10:55.880
through the lens of what I believe in,

10:56.800 --> 10:58.520
wouldn't that be a magnificent sight?

11:05.240 --> 11:05.840
Wang Xi.

11:07.720 --> 11:08.320
Prepare the ink.

11:08.400 --> 11:09.000
Right away.

11:37.000 --> 11:41.840
(Chronicle of Unusual Spirits)

11:46.120 --> 11:47.800
What junk did Zhan Lu give me?

11:48.040 --> 11:49.880
Is he mocking me?

11:50.120 --> 11:51.440
I'll slice it in half!

11:52.880 --> 11:54.320
The burr puzzle is easy to take apart

11:55.200 --> 11:56.680
but hard to put back together.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.400
You find it frustrating,

11:58.800 --> 11:59.680
but you do not realize

12:00.000 --> 12:02.200
the trivial matters of this world
are far more complicated

12:02.320 --> 12:03.600
than this puzzle.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.840
My alliance with Shen Zaiye
has two goals.

12:07.840 --> 12:10.480
One, to expose
the heir's counterfeiting operation

12:11.160 --> 12:12.320
and avenge Granny.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.200
Two, to uncover

12:14.280 --> 12:15.760
how all this ties back to Empress Lv.

12:16.520 --> 12:18.320
Only then can we gain the upper hand

12:18.760 --> 12:20.280
and negotiate with her on equal terms.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.680
But you and the Chancellor

12:22.760 --> 12:24.800
are operating right
under His Highness's nose today.

12:24.880 --> 12:25.840
It must be dangerous.

12:26.680 --> 12:29.160
Just let that treacherous chancellor
investigate on his own.

12:29.960 --> 12:30.560
No.

12:31.880 --> 12:33.120
No matter what lies

12:33.480 --> 12:34.720
behind this hunting ground,

12:35.160 --> 12:36.600
for the sake of Changjue and myself,

12:36.880 --> 12:38.040
I have to go.

12:39.840 --> 12:40.880
Prepare two sets of clothing

12:40.960 --> 12:42.400
that are easy to move in.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.200
Mu Wuxia!

13:02.640 --> 13:03.240
Mu Wuxia!

13:04.160 --> 13:05.720
I just washed these grapes. Want some?

13:09.880 --> 13:11.160
Come on! The banquet's starting!

13:14.280 --> 13:14.880
Everyone,

13:15.520 --> 13:17.800
today we hold the Flowing Cups Banquet.

13:18.200 --> 13:20.160
Let us play a drinking game
where we compose poetry

13:20.480 --> 13:21.480
themed around flowers.

13:22.280 --> 13:23.400
If you can't come up with one,

13:23.480 --> 13:24.520
drink as your punishment.

13:24.600 --> 13:25.320
What do you think?

13:25.680 --> 13:27.080
- Good.
- Excellent idea.

13:27.240 --> 13:28.200
- Great.
- Splendid.

13:28.480 --> 13:30.760
Very well. I shall begin.

13:31.720 --> 13:33.320
Plum by the window, blossoms late.

13:33.880 --> 13:36.120
Bamboo in the pond, shoots newly sprout.

13:37.080 --> 13:37.680
Wonderful.

13:37.760 --> 13:38.440
What do you think?

13:38.520 --> 13:39.120
Very nice.

13:39.520 --> 13:40.480
Let me give it a try.

13:41.480 --> 13:42.840
Plum and willow planted by the gate,

13:42.920 --> 13:44.440
a single branch bearing lovely flowers.

13:45.320 --> 13:46.880
A true scholar
of the Meng family indeed.

13:49.280 --> 13:49.880
And you,

13:50.960 --> 13:51.760
Chancellor Shen?

13:53.160 --> 13:54.280
Forgive my poor attempt.

13:55.520 --> 13:57.240
A branch leans
across the moon-viewing tower.

13:57.840 --> 13:59.560
Flowers surround the terrace of wind.

14:00.120 --> 14:00.840
Excellent.

14:01.760 --> 14:02.720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

14:04.000 --> 14:04.640
Here, here.

14:05.280 --> 14:07.120
We have good wine and good poetry.

14:08.120 --> 14:09.160
Here's to everyone

14:09.680 --> 14:12.520
making great catches during the hunt.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.080
Drink up!

14:28.800 --> 14:30.520
The weather is fair and bright.

14:30.680 --> 14:31.680
The skies are clear.

14:31.880 --> 14:33.200
The delicacies are endless.

14:34.400 --> 14:35.000
Everyone,

14:35.200 --> 14:36.560
drink freely and enjoy yourselves.

14:37.040 --> 14:38.640
Don't let Wugou's hospitality
go to waste.

14:38.720 --> 14:40.720
Thank you, Father,
for gracing these hunting grounds.

14:40.800 --> 14:41.640
I'll drink to that.

14:54.960 --> 14:55.600
Chancellor Shen,

14:55.840 --> 14:56.680
a toast to you.

15:00.200 --> 15:00.840
Cheers!

15:16.800 --> 15:17.440
Chancellor Shen.

15:19.000 --> 15:22.240
I won't be holding back
during this hunt.

15:37.400 --> 15:38.000
Chancellor.

15:42.640 --> 15:44.040
It's time.

15:44.640 --> 15:45.440
Begin the operation.

15:57.600 --> 15:58.560
Chancellor,

15:59.960 --> 16:02.320
I want you to feed me a drink.

16:16.840 --> 16:17.960
Forgive me.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.960
I shall go and change.

16:27.320 --> 16:28.080
Your Majesty.

16:28.480 --> 16:30.880
My concubine conducted herself poorly
in front of the court.

16:30.960 --> 16:33.920
I will come offer my apologies later.

16:34.000 --> 16:36.360
Come join me
for a game of chess after this.

16:37.040 --> 16:37.840
Yes, Your Majesty.

16:41.160 --> 16:41.800
Chancellor.

16:43.280 --> 16:43.880
I'm fine.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.080
I'm fine.

17:11.359 --> 17:11.960
Where is it?

17:12.800 --> 17:14.160
Is the spot Zhan Lu gave accurate?

17:14.800 --> 17:15.839
It should be up ahead.

17:23.880 --> 17:24.599
This is the place.

17:34.040 --> 17:35.280
This should be the place

17:35.920 --> 17:37.600
he said they buried it in a hurry.

18:29.600 --> 18:30.240
We were right.

18:30.720 --> 18:31.720
This is silver ore.

18:35.600 --> 18:36.880
We thought the counterfeit money

18:37.280 --> 18:38.040
was just cheap alloy

18:38.120 --> 18:39.760
mixed in by someone.

18:40.120 --> 18:42.160
We never expected it
to be a real silver mine.

18:42.720 --> 18:44.800
Illegally mining silver
is a crime punishable by death.

18:45.080 --> 18:46.520
How could Prince Wugou be so bold?

18:48.160 --> 18:49.360
He's backed by the Meng family.

18:49.880 --> 18:51.040
Nothing he does is surprising.

19:11.240 --> 19:12.560
Huaijin, you're clever.

19:13.080 --> 19:14.200
You left a flaw on purpose,

19:14.280 --> 19:15.640
and Shen Zaiye fell right into it.

19:16.480 --> 19:17.280
Next…

19:18.520 --> 19:19.520
Next…

19:22.200 --> 19:25.360
Chancellor Shen and his concubine, drunk,
accidentally wander into this spot.

19:26.240 --> 19:28.880
Suddenly, the long-dried hot spring
begins flowing again.

19:29.280 --> 19:31.160
They both fall in by accident

19:32.680 --> 19:34.480
and drown.

19:42.400 --> 19:43.680
Where did all that water come from?

19:43.760 --> 19:44.640
Let's get out of here!

19:48.360 --> 19:49.600
It was a trap.

19:50.640 --> 19:51.640
We have to go.

19:53.240 --> 19:53.960
Come on!

20:05.440 --> 20:06.320
My foot's stuck!

20:23.960 --> 20:24.720
Shen Zaiye!

20:51.960 --> 20:52.560
Take this.

20:53.200 --> 20:53.840
You came back.

20:53.920 --> 20:54.520
Hurry!

21:28.600 --> 21:29.920
Mr. Meng, we've done as ordered.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.080
The cave is fully flooded.

21:31.720 --> 21:32.400
Good.

21:35.280 --> 21:36.400
The silver mine is well hidden.

21:36.480 --> 21:37.480
Wait three to five days,

21:37.800 --> 21:39.600
then send someone to recover the bodies.

21:39.760 --> 21:41.040
Say they were found downstream.

21:41.440 --> 21:42.920
I've arranged
for a coroner and witnesses

21:43.000 --> 21:44.160
to testify before His Majesty.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.960
You are certainly thorough.

21:47.800 --> 21:48.680
After the spring hunt,

21:48.880 --> 21:51.840
the story of Chancellor Shen and his
concubine drowning in drunken misfortune

21:52.360 --> 21:53.960
will spread across Yujing.

21:54.400 --> 21:55.800
We'll spread rumors

21:56.040 --> 21:57.640
that their ghosts haunt this place.

21:57.720 --> 21:59.760
No one will dare come near
the hunting grounds again.

22:00.480 --> 22:01.280
And your silver mine

22:01.840 --> 22:02.960
will be safe

22:03.320 --> 22:04.840
from suspicion.

22:05.320 --> 22:06.240
Brilliant plan.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.480
We might raise suspicion

22:11.000 --> 22:12.240
if we're away for too long.

22:12.480 --> 22:13.080
Let us return.

22:28.200 --> 22:29.680
This stone must weigh over 1,000 jin.

22:30.160 --> 22:32.240
We won't be able to move it on our own.

22:32.720 --> 22:33.800
We'll have to wait for help.

22:34.720 --> 22:35.880
Jiang Taohua, stay strong.

22:36.680 --> 22:37.480
Don't give up.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.160
I'm not giving up.

22:41.040 --> 22:43.560
How else would I avenge Granny?

22:50.640 --> 22:51.960
No one stays weak forever.

22:53.040 --> 22:54.880
With brushes, words, or swords,

22:54.960 --> 22:56.840
they'll all learn
to protect those they cherish!

23:05.560 --> 23:06.680
(Even on the brink of death,)

23:07.280 --> 23:08.600
(she's still thinking of others.)

23:14.720 --> 23:16.000
Prince Wugou could never come up

23:16.800 --> 23:18.600
with a plan this sinister.

23:19.360 --> 23:21.200
This must be Meng Huaijin's handiwork.

23:22.080 --> 23:23.080
If we are

23:24.000 --> 23:25.120
to die here

23:25.680 --> 23:26.800
this day,

23:27.880 --> 23:28.480
then though

23:29.440 --> 23:30.960
we never lay together in life,

23:31.560 --> 23:32.800
we will share a grave in death.

23:34.480 --> 23:35.200
That, too,

23:35.640 --> 23:36.880
is a bond destined.

23:39.360 --> 23:40.240
When put that way,

23:40.800 --> 23:41.640
it's not so terrible.

24:06.480 --> 24:07.760
It was just here a moment ago.

24:08.320 --> 24:09.120
Where did it go?

24:09.720 --> 24:11.080
Find it!

24:11.440 --> 24:12.320
Yes, Your Majesty.

24:15.400 --> 24:16.000
Father.

24:20.080 --> 24:20.680
Father.

24:21.560 --> 24:23.600
Did you lose something important?

24:25.640 --> 24:26.760
How did you know?

24:29.040 --> 24:30.000
Is this the piece

24:30.760 --> 24:31.920
Your Majesty was looking for?

24:33.000 --> 24:34.920
I'm positive
I already captured that piece.

24:40.880 --> 24:41.960
Yes, that's the one.

24:43.640 --> 24:44.360
Let's continue.

24:45.560 --> 24:46.520
What are you doing here?

24:49.360 --> 24:50.720
Whatever does Your Highness mean?

24:51.200 --> 24:52.240
Where else am I supposed

24:52.640 --> 24:53.520
to be?

25:17.240 --> 25:17.840
Your Highness.

25:19.640 --> 25:20.680
Go get Huaijin.

25:21.240 --> 25:22.360
Let him come see

25:22.640 --> 25:24.280
this so-called "foolproof" plan of his.

25:24.800 --> 25:26.040
Your Highness, please calm down.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.800
Shen Zaiye just returned
to the banquet alone.

25:29.120 --> 25:30.680
He didn't seem the least bit suspicious.

25:31.320 --> 25:32.040
Alone?

25:40.640 --> 25:42.560
Jiang Taohua is carrying a bag.

25:44.080 --> 25:46.200
Could they have discovered something
in the silver mine?

26:00.120 --> 26:01.520
Your Highness, please step outside.

26:01.720 --> 26:02.800
There are only women inside.

26:04.120 --> 26:04.840
Get out.

26:08.720 --> 26:09.400
I said, get out!

26:21.280 --> 26:23.480
I lost something very important.

26:24.440 --> 26:26.200
It looks quite similar
to what you're holding.

26:27.800 --> 26:29.360
This is not Your Highness's.

26:30.320 --> 26:32.960
Please stop making a scene.

26:33.600 --> 26:34.760
If you're so sure,

26:35.280 --> 26:37.360
then you won't mind if I take a look.

26:39.880 --> 26:41.000
You may inspect it

26:41.800 --> 26:43.040
but please step outside first

26:43.360 --> 26:44.600
so as not to disturb the others.

26:45.160 --> 26:47.520
I won't be told what to do
by a concubine!

26:51.120 --> 26:52.320
I'd like to see

26:53.000 --> 26:54.400
what tricks you're playing.

27:09.880 --> 27:10.600
How dare you!

27:13.120 --> 27:14.440
Please be appeased, Your Highness.

27:14.920 --> 27:16.120
This was my mistake.

27:16.960 --> 27:17.960
Prince Wugou insisted

27:18.440 --> 27:19.640
on barging in.

27:20.000 --> 27:21.200
I couldn't stop him.

27:24.760 --> 27:25.880
You dare make a fool of me?

27:31.680 --> 27:32.440
Are you all right?

27:33.920 --> 27:35.560
Prince Wugou,
what is the meaning of this?

27:39.680 --> 27:40.480
Chancellor.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.760
Consort Lan was changing clothes.

27:42.880 --> 27:44.920
I was hurrying to deliver her
a change of garments.

27:45.440 --> 27:48.560
Who would've thought Prince Wugou
would follow me all the way here,

27:49.120 --> 27:51.240
barge into Consort Lan's tent,

27:52.000 --> 27:54.200
and demand to see her clothing?

27:54.680 --> 27:55.400
Insolent!

27:58.960 --> 27:59.760
Are you all right?

28:01.360 --> 28:03.400
You even dared intrude
on Consort Lan's private tent.

28:04.080 --> 28:05.320
I'm not dead yet!

28:07.680 --> 28:08.280
Father,

28:08.920 --> 28:10.560
I meant no disrespect to Consort Lan.

28:10.640 --> 28:11.240
It was Shen…

28:11.320 --> 28:11.960
Your Majesty.

28:13.600 --> 28:14.560
His Highness was helping me

28:14.640 --> 28:15.760
search for a lost jade pendant.

28:15.840 --> 28:17.240
He entered the wrong tent by mistake.

28:17.320 --> 28:19.080
He had no intention
of offending Consort Lan.

28:20.600 --> 28:21.200
That's right.

28:22.360 --> 28:23.680
Huaijin lost his pendant.

28:24.560 --> 28:26.960
I saw Lady Jiang acting suspiciously
and followed her.

28:27.960 --> 28:30.440
I didn't realize
it was Consort Lan's tent.

28:31.480 --> 28:32.160
Your Majesty.

28:32.320 --> 28:33.320
I accidentally spilled wine

28:33.400 --> 28:34.880
on my clothes earlier.

28:35.040 --> 28:37.080
I asked the Chancellor's concubine
to help me change.

28:37.560 --> 28:39.360
Prince Wugou barged in

28:39.800 --> 28:41.320
and now claims he lost his pendant.

28:42.320 --> 28:43.200
Is he accusing me

28:43.480 --> 28:45.720
of stealing it?

28:47.000 --> 28:48.480
How could I ever suspect you, my love?

28:48.680 --> 28:50.000
You've always been so understanding.

28:50.080 --> 28:51.200
You wouldn't do anything wrong.

28:51.280 --> 28:52.360
It was His Highness's mistake.

28:52.440 --> 28:53.440
He misunderstood Lady Jiang,

28:53.520 --> 28:54.920
and ended up disturbing Consort Lan.

28:55.080 --> 28:55.800
He was just nervous

28:55.880 --> 28:57.360
because he cared about Your Majesty.

28:57.600 --> 28:58.200
After all,

28:58.280 --> 29:00.200
the security of the hunting grounds
is his responsibility.

29:01.320 --> 29:02.720
I was too on edge.

29:03.560 --> 29:05.840
I apologize to Consort Lan.

29:09.840 --> 29:11.640
Since Prince Wugou has admitted fault,

29:12.160 --> 29:13.480
I will let the matter rest.

29:26.200 --> 29:27.560
So this is where everyone went.

29:28.000 --> 29:30.480
I was wondering
why the banquet felt so empty.

29:31.400 --> 29:32.040
Father,

29:32.480 --> 29:34.520
what's the prize for tomorrow's hunt?

29:34.600 --> 29:36.120
You'd better not go back on your word.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.040
You insolent child.

29:42.280 --> 29:43.840
You've conducted yourself poorly.

29:43.960 --> 29:45.120
Since it's your first offense,

29:45.320 --> 29:46.520
I'll only give you ten lashes.

29:46.600 --> 29:47.560
Go take your punishment.

29:49.120 --> 29:49.840
Let's go.

29:50.320 --> 29:51.720
Forgive me, Father.

30:12.200 --> 30:13.640
Chancellor and Lady Jiang

30:14.200 --> 30:15.640
really do make such a loving pair.

30:16.200 --> 30:17.680
I'm envious.

30:18.960 --> 30:20.280
Please excuse us, Prince Wuyin.

30:20.880 --> 30:22.040
Lady Jiang was startled.

30:22.320 --> 30:23.600
She needs rest.

30:43.880 --> 30:45.240
You even managed to involve

30:45.320 --> 30:46.640
His Majesty's favored Consort Lan.

30:47.040 --> 30:48.000
You've got guts.

30:49.560 --> 30:50.480
Those ten lashes

30:51.360 --> 30:53.320
will at least vent some of Lian's fury.

31:02.280 --> 31:02.880
Yes.

31:04.000 --> 31:05.080
This is only the beginning.

31:06.040 --> 31:07.520
Prince Wugou will pay the price

31:07.600 --> 31:08.720
for everything he's done.

31:11.400 --> 31:12.000
Let's go.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.360
Did you twist your ankle?

31:34.440 --> 31:35.200
I'm fine.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.600
Put me down!

31:38.440 --> 31:40.000
All of Yujing knows

31:40.480 --> 31:42.040
you're my favored concubine.

31:42.760 --> 31:44.200
His concubine's injury

31:44.880 --> 31:47.560
has the treacherous chancellor
worried and panicked.

31:47.960 --> 31:49.280
That's the way it should be.

31:51.360 --> 31:52.840
You're quite the actor.

32:10.080 --> 32:13.640
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

32:13.720 --> 32:17.120
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

32:17.640 --> 32:19.760
Is Chancellor Shen
carrying Princess Chengping?

32:21.800 --> 32:22.880
The Left Chancellor

32:23.080 --> 32:25.560
makes a spectacle
of carrying his concubine around.

32:27.720 --> 32:28.880
How inappropriate!

32:30.240 --> 32:32.200
The daughter of Meng is present too.

32:33.680 --> 32:34.520
Who would've thought

32:34.600 --> 32:36.960
Chancellor Shen would have
such a romantic bone in him?

32:39.040 --> 32:43.200
♪Though shackles
bind my soul and chain my form♪

32:43.280 --> 32:46.320
♪I've walked through life
and death before♪

32:46.400 --> 32:53.040
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

32:53.320 --> 32:57.320
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

32:57.520 --> 33:00.320
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

33:00.480 --> 33:07.480
♪Forged in stardust and flame,
I rise with an unyielding frame♪

33:24.560 --> 33:25.400
No bandages.

33:26.400 --> 33:27.920
Earlier, it all happened so quickly.

33:28.080 --> 33:29.160
Prince Wugou was flustered.

33:30.000 --> 33:31.200
If he finds out

33:31.280 --> 33:33.200
I'm also injured on my hand and leg,

33:33.480 --> 33:34.640
he definitely won't let it go.

33:34.880 --> 33:36.200
It's all Chancellor Shen's fault.

33:36.320 --> 33:38.480
Just a moment with him,
and Your Highness ended up hurt.

33:39.120 --> 33:41.200
If it weren't for his careful planning,

33:41.600 --> 33:42.440
I might have died

33:43.040 --> 33:44.920
in that mine.

33:59.600 --> 34:00.280
Chancellor!

34:01.520 --> 34:02.120
It's me!

34:02.400 --> 34:03.800
Why did you arrive later than planned?

34:03.880 --> 34:05.200
They were still flooding the cave.

34:05.280 --> 34:06.680
I was worried coming out too early

34:06.760 --> 34:07.680
would ruin your plan.

34:08.239 --> 34:09.239
There's no time to waste.

34:10.040 --> 34:11.840
Hurry and take Lady Jiang back
to the tent.

34:12.960 --> 34:14.199
I must return to the banquet.

34:14.280 --> 34:14.880
Yes, sir.

34:14.960 --> 34:15.560
The clothes?

34:15.719 --> 34:16.320
Right here.

34:18.679 --> 34:20.080
I'll return to the banquet with you.

34:20.159 --> 34:21.159
That won't be necessary.

34:21.880 --> 34:22.840
You're weak.

34:23.000 --> 34:23.840
You need rest.

34:24.159 --> 34:24.760
Prince Wugou

34:24.840 --> 34:26.920
won't dare utter a word
even if he sees me return alone.

34:27.000 --> 34:27.840
I'm fine.

34:28.639 --> 34:30.040
It'll be difficult to explain things

34:30.280 --> 34:31.880
if you return alone.

34:33.600 --> 34:34.199
All right.

34:34.719 --> 34:36.239
That was too dangerous, Your Highness.

34:36.679 --> 34:38.320
If there's another time,

34:38.520 --> 34:40.280
let that treacherous chancellor
act alone.

34:40.920 --> 34:43.159
You mustn't expose yourself
to danger again.

34:43.639 --> 34:45.639
After all the times
Prince Wugou schemed against us,

34:46.199 --> 34:46.880
we finally got

34:47.280 --> 34:48.639
a little payback.

34:49.639 --> 34:50.440
Besides,

34:50.719 --> 34:51.880
if I hadn't gone,

34:52.080 --> 34:54.440
how would I have discovered
what Empress Lv was really after?

34:54.639 --> 34:55.600
You figured it out?

34:59.200 --> 35:01.320
It wasn't until
I reached that silver mine

35:01.760 --> 35:03.200
that I understood her true objective.

35:04.160 --> 35:05.320
That much money

35:05.600 --> 35:07.440
is more than enough for her

35:08.040 --> 35:10.480
to bribe officials in Beiyuan,
raise assassins, or even an army.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.520
The silver mine
and the counterfeit money

35:14.960 --> 35:16.080
all tie back to Prince Wugou.

35:16.680 --> 35:18.240
Once his crimes come to light,

35:18.320 --> 35:19.280
he will be deposed.

35:19.920 --> 35:21.960
Then the other princes of Qi will fight

35:22.160 --> 35:23.880
for the title of heir.

35:24.400 --> 35:26.120
Amid the chaos,

35:26.520 --> 35:28.360
Empress Lv will reap the benefits.

35:28.600 --> 35:30.000
That's her real plan.

35:30.160 --> 35:31.400
Has she lost her mind?

35:35.240 --> 35:36.840
Qi has strong troops
and skilled generals.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.840
They have long been waiting for a chance

35:38.920 --> 35:40.840
to wear down
the exhausted Beiyuan forces.

35:42.000 --> 35:42.920
All they lack

35:43.120 --> 35:44.400
is a justifiable cause

35:44.520 --> 35:46.120
to convince the court
to dispatch troops.

35:47.240 --> 35:48.680
If Empress Lv's actions are exposed,

35:49.120 --> 35:51.480
there will be no more voices in Qi
calling for peace.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.360
Empress Lv is ambitious.

35:53.440 --> 35:55.520
She will end up dragging
all of Beiyuan down with her.

35:55.840 --> 35:57.320
We must put a stop to her.

35:57.640 --> 35:59.240
Still, it's too dangerous.

35:59.640 --> 36:01.320
We should go into hiding

36:01.400 --> 36:03.440
and wait until the chaos is over.

36:03.960 --> 36:05.840
We're already involved.

36:05.960 --> 36:07.240
It's too late for us to withdraw.

36:07.840 --> 36:09.040
Then again,

36:09.560 --> 36:10.600
a crisis

36:10.920 --> 36:12.240
may also be an opportunity.

36:13.360 --> 36:14.560
If we form the right alliances

36:14.640 --> 36:15.640
and coordinate well,

36:16.280 --> 36:17.880
this might just become the breakthrough

36:18.000 --> 36:19.960
I need to counter Empress Lv.

36:21.520 --> 36:23.520
And this "breakthrough"

36:23.680 --> 36:25.240
lies with that treacherous chancellor?

36:28.120 --> 36:29.320
At this point,

36:29.640 --> 36:30.640
Shen Zaiye is the last straw

36:30.720 --> 36:32.000
we can cling to.

36:33.160 --> 36:34.360
But that chancellor

36:34.800 --> 36:36.240
is not someone easily dealt with.

36:38.600 --> 36:39.560
We can't remain passive.

36:40.680 --> 36:41.800
If we wish to win him over,

36:42.600 --> 36:44.040
we must offer a token of allegiance.

36:44.400 --> 36:45.680
What token?

36:46.240 --> 36:47.240
One decisive move.

36:47.960 --> 36:50.040
One that will leave no doubt in his mind
of my loyalty.

36:58.800 --> 36:59.960
Useless pigs!

37:00.800 --> 37:01.960
Forgive me, Your Highness.

37:04.480 --> 37:05.800
Your Highness, please be appeased.

37:13.360 --> 37:14.600
Cursing a servant to let off steam

37:14.680 --> 37:15.920
is nothing unusual.

37:16.160 --> 37:17.400
But you just took ten lashes.

37:17.560 --> 37:18.920
Don't tear your wounds open.

37:22.800 --> 37:23.720
Fortunately,

37:23.800 --> 37:24.920
the guards knew to hold back.

37:25.080 --> 37:26.480
They didn't dare strike too hard.

37:26.960 --> 37:28.680
With medicine,
you'll be fine in a few days.

37:29.880 --> 37:31.680
Jiang Taohua looked so flustered

37:33.200 --> 37:34.000
I thought

37:34.640 --> 37:36.400
she was hiding something important.

37:37.400 --> 37:38.600
I got whipped because of her.

37:39.840 --> 37:42.200
Father even criticized me
in front of everyone.

37:43.680 --> 37:44.920
I am the heir!

37:45.560 --> 37:47.440
He showed me no regard at all.

37:47.960 --> 37:49.920
Shen Zaiye is a calculating schemer.

37:50.360 --> 37:52.560
That concubine of his
is sly and adaptable too.

37:53.840 --> 37:55.280
Your Highness must be vigilant,

37:55.720 --> 37:56.640
or they'll lead you

37:56.720 --> 37:58.800
straight into disaster
before you know it.

37:59.960 --> 38:01.440
Didn't you say the plan was foolproof?

38:02.040 --> 38:03.360
How did they escape?

38:03.840 --> 38:06.280
There was a man-made opening
at the top of the mine.

38:06.760 --> 38:08.720
Shen Zaiye must have had
a backup plan all along.

38:10.280 --> 38:11.880
How are they still alive after all this?

38:12.560 --> 38:13.840
We tried to kill them many times.

38:14.080 --> 38:15.080
Yet, they just won't die!

38:16.720 --> 38:17.560
All the more reason

38:17.640 --> 38:19.120
to stay calm and level-headed.

38:20.160 --> 38:21.280
What matters most now

38:21.360 --> 38:23.240
is to get through the spring hunt.

38:24.000 --> 38:25.760
We mustn't lose control
of the situation.

38:26.080 --> 38:27.400
Am I simply to accept these lashes

38:28.160 --> 38:29.000
while they walk free?

38:29.600 --> 38:30.440
Patience.

38:31.600 --> 38:33.120
They're in our territory now.

38:33.600 --> 38:35.560
Sooner or later,
they'll drop their guard.

38:37.480 --> 38:38.760
The spring hunt is tomorrow.

38:40.800 --> 38:42.960
Father won't discover the mine, will he?

38:43.280 --> 38:43.880
Rest assured.

38:44.240 --> 38:45.120
Everything's arranged.

38:46.040 --> 38:47.480
Do as I say

38:48.000 --> 38:49.320
and all will be fine.

38:58.240 --> 38:59.400
We have the physical evidence.

39:00.160 --> 39:01.680
What we still need is a witness.

39:03.680 --> 39:05.760
If we can find the workers
who used to be in that mine,

39:06.080 --> 39:07.680
and safely escort them to His Majesty,

39:07.760 --> 39:09.160
then we'll have everything we need.

39:09.920 --> 39:11.280
According to Lian,

39:11.720 --> 39:13.600
the overseers recruit new laborers

39:14.280 --> 39:16.080
at regular intervals.

39:16.760 --> 39:17.920
Such a large number

39:18.520 --> 39:20.520
can't be hidden in an ordinary place.

39:22.720 --> 39:24.200
Given how hastily they moved

39:24.800 --> 39:26.160
and the sheer size of their group,

39:27.400 --> 39:28.520
they surely haven't gone far.

39:31.200 --> 39:33.080
They must be somewhere
near this hunting ground.

39:55.240 --> 39:55.960
This is the place.

40:24.720 --> 40:25.880
I'll come up with something

40:26.000 --> 40:27.000
to rescue those laborers.

40:27.240 --> 40:28.480
But to avoid raising suspicion,

40:28.720 --> 40:29.560
tomorrow…

40:29.640 --> 40:30.840
Do it.

40:32.040 --> 40:33.640
I'll buy you as much time as I can.

40:35.800 --> 40:36.400
That won't do.

40:36.840 --> 40:38.120
I'll have someone else handle it.

40:38.200 --> 40:39.720
I'm the most suitable one for the task,

40:40.080 --> 40:41.680
and the least likely
to arouse suspicion.

40:43.640 --> 40:44.520
Don't worry.

40:44.880 --> 40:46.320
I'll act when the opportunity arises.

41:00.880 --> 41:02.280
His Majesty gave me this as a reward.

41:02.360 --> 41:03.200
I have no use for it.

41:05.600 --> 41:06.720
Thank you.

41:10.040 --> 41:11.760
I'll probably have duties
to attend to tonight.

41:11.840 --> 41:13.520
It'll be more convenient for me
to stay here.

41:13.600 --> 41:15.040
You don't have to sleep on the floor.

41:15.160 --> 41:15.800
Take the bed.

41:15.920 --> 41:21.920
♪The closer our fluttering hearts
draw near, the more they try to hide♪

41:23.520 --> 41:29.840
♪The deeper my thoughts grow
for you at night♪

41:30.160 --> 41:35.080
♪The more afraid I am of losing you♪

41:37.000 --> 41:40.320
♪Your eyes sparkle like the stars
that adorn the night♪

41:40.400 --> 41:42.840
♪Ever so bright, ever so pure♪

41:44.000 --> 41:46.040
♪Reflecting all beneath
the heavens and the earth♪

41:46.400 --> 41:48.560
Be careful tomorrow.

41:50.960 --> 41:54.440
♪Though fierce winds rage,
the candle's flame burns warm♪

41:54.760 --> 41:57.880
♪Etching our longing into a vow♪

41:58.040 --> 42:01.320
♪Though parting looms,
no price too great to pay♪

42:01.480 --> 42:04.880
♪In life and death,
our hearts will never stray♪

42:28.000 --> 42:31.200
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

42:31.280 --> 42:34.320
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

42:35.240 --> 42:38.360
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

42:38.480 --> 42:42.240
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

42:42.520 --> 42:45.600
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

42:45.720 --> 42:49.040
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

42:49.440 --> 42:53.000
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

42:53.080 --> 42:58.800
♪With no one it can be brought♪

43:03.760 --> 43:10.680
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

43:11.120 --> 43:17.960
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

43:18.440 --> 43:25.440
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

43:25.760 --> 43:29.800
♪Even if it means this flower♪

43:29.920 --> 43:36.880
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

43:48.000 --> 43:51.120
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

43:51.200 --> 43:54.440
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

43:54.800 --> 43:58.480
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

43:58.600 --> 44:05.160
♪No longer needing to say♪

44:09.240 --> 44:16.160
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

44:16.560 --> 44:23.520
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

44:23.880 --> 44:30.880
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

44:31.240 --> 44:32.920
♪And finding♪

44:33.000 --> 44:40.000
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
